# Lantern — 01 / Ignition

An original, text-free loading-screen motion study: a weathered iron lantern suspended in a near-black void. A weak orange wick grows into a controlled amber flame. Its light reveals the oil reservoir, arch tracery and worn inner metal. Cold edge reflections remain restrained. The background stays quiet.

## Finished files

- `deliverables/Lantern_01_Ignition_Preview_60fps.mp4` — 8.00 seconds, 480 frames
- `deliverables/Lantern_01_Intro_60fps.mp4` — 2.50 seconds, 150 frames
- `deliverables/Lantern_01_Hold_Loop_60fps.mp4` — 4.00 seconds, 240 frames, seamless periodic hold
- `deliverables/Lantern_01_Complete_60fps.mp4` — 1.50 seconds, 90 frames
